  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.12.1 - Correctness fixes surfaced by a real Windows Server Failover Cluster run. An Online cluster disk (cluster resource state 2) now reads as Online rather than Offline in the SCSI-3 phase. A cluster that uses a disk witness under dynamic quorum now reports as NodeAndDiskMajority rather than being mislabeled NodeMajority. A missing optional MPIO module is now a Warning rather than a hard failure on clusters with no multipath SAN. Checks that were already correct are unchanged.",
